review:
@4 hours: Tic-Tacs for days.

This is a fun nod to bullet-hells with some rpg/loot elements. The engaging bit for me so far is using the loot [space blocks] to build your own ship in a quick free-form way that pairs nicely with the "foreboding ink" theme.
The story is there as well so even though the art is pretty basic/stylized you can let your imagination wander and add all the head cannon you want
